block newsvariables
  - var newskey = '2023-05-05-posters-accepted-for-eurovis-2023';

//-
  block date
    | [date]

  block title
    | [title]

block newscontent
  p.card-text
  p Two posters got accepted for publication at the EG Conference on Visualization (EuroVis '23).
  ul
    li Tim Cech, Furkan Simsek, Willy Scheibel, and Jürgen Döllner: "A Dashboard for Interactive Convolutional Neural Network Training And Validation Through Saliency Maps"
    li Willy Scheibel and Jürgen Döllner: "Constructing Hierarchical Continuity in Hilbert & Moore Treemaps"
  p
    | The conference takes place from June 12 to 16 in Leipzig, Germany. For more information, 
    a.external(href="https://www.eurovis.org/" target="_blank") visit the website
    | .
